# The extraction plan this repository was built from. It carries the private
# project's production domain, IP and root SSH line, so it is never committed —
# and never sent to Docker either, since the Dockerfile builds with `COPY . .`
# and a gitignored file still lands in the builder image layer.
# Only this file is excluded; docs/images/ holds the tracked README screenshots.
docs/SHOWCASE-AUDIT.md

# The active development plan. It lists every known weakness in this codebase and
# discusses how the repository reads to a reviewer, so it stays private until the
# fixes land — and, like the audit above, out of the builder image too.
docs/plan.md
